# Machine-specific config - real usernames, password hashes, disk UUIDs.
# Copy the matching *.nix.example next to these and fill it in; the build
# refuses to evaluate without them (see modules/hosts/Diablo/Host.nix).
modules/hosts/*/_hardware.nix
modules/hosts/*/_user.nix

